## Executive Summary & Group Verdicts

| Group | Committed Proof Manifest (`SHA256.json`) | Commit ID | Verdict | Core Finding Summary |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **1. Notice Generation & Installer Source** | `95b2737c539cc40e7121a6ac325e5a7a52093ea1cd29d94f6ed29476ceddbe3e` | `71d3e70d2bbe8482154443912065920f4ffb3bce` | **Accept with findings** | Notice generation remains mandatory when `pip-licenses` is unavailable, using `importlib.metadata`; non-zero generator exits remain fatal after cleanup; exact four notice files are verified against pinned hashes and staged; `StageSourceOnly` skips generation but stages truthful source notices; line-ending expansion postcheck failure in tool `9788ef` was repaired in `fa439f` before passing checkout run `3a56e1`; inert test seams do not substitute for a full installer build or legal clearance. |
| **2. Generated Drain & Cancellation** | `b3a71b9e963f2b058f689214ce6f6ffaaa261daea36b8349d63f1e95c347d334` | `7fba83aa1ed2722b2a65c28c9a5222b27c7b9fe8` | **Accept with findings** | Native observations `drain01` (tool `8f8823`, exit 0) and `cancel01` (tool `752948`, exit 0) verify lazy segment generation, cancellation before read, post-close refusal without IPC wire usage, and pending-I/O retirement; parent guards hold through child exit 0 and empty job, followed by 5 write-open successes (0 bytes); dispatch/audit totals agree (drain 304/270, cancel 289/255); initial admission failed (`36af0d`) due to unsupported `Set-Content -NoClobber` before `FileMode.CreateNew` repair (`72420c`); child explicitly records `complete_native_namespace_protection: false`; sentinel profile uses 328-byte ASCII placeholders, establishing no real model loading or durable crash recovery. |
| **3. Actual Adapter Connection on Windows** | `a0ff3c9f488dedf4b58740a545cf76fa45bf3e7c4541978a5643fc29573bbeb6` | `7ced13425374deefa0c67e1bc40563adf79d11b0` | **Accept with findings** | Native run `fc23ea` (exit 0, 0.9092s) observes actual `faster_whisper_session`, factory, `_NativePermit`, and adapter-owned cleanup with generated data; admission protected, binding reserved with no owner, startup reserved with installed owner, running marked only after child policy ack; exact 15-field CPU/int8 reliability policy bound with ack digest `91fd7a45...`; controller/child dispatch and audit agree at 319/285 with 5 true adapter-state checks; module allowlist updated cleanly for 3 added modules with pending-I/O abort intact; observation uses temporary test seams with unconfigured production globals and does not qualify weights, decoding, VAD, crash recovery, or complete native loader namespace protection. |

---

## Concrete Actionable Findings

### Group 1: Notice Generation and Installer Source
- **Finding G1-01 (Integration Process Defect / Resolved)**: Tool `9788ef` returned exit 1 because Git's `core.autocrlf=true` expanded LF lines into CRLF during `git apply --3way`. Documented in [`integrator/TWO-WHEEL-NOTICE-INTEGRATION-EOL-REPAIR-BRIEF.md`](file:///C:/Users/hello/AppData/Local/AgentControlRoom/worktrees/uoink-library/e30846da-321/gemini/docs/library/proof/two-wheel-notice-integration-2026-09-13/integrator/TWO-WHEEL-NOTICE-INTEGRATION-EOL-REPAIR-BRIEF.md); tool `fa439f` restored all eight qualified after-files and verified normalized line equality before the passing checkout run `3a56e1`.
- **Finding G1-02 (Scope Limitation)**: The 10 PowerShell block cases in [`author/run_build_blocks.ps1`](file:///C:/Users/hello/AppData/Local/AgentControlRoom/worktrees/uoink-library/e30846da-321/gemini/docs/library/proof/two-wheel-notice-integration-2026-09-13/author/run_build_blocks.ps1#L40-L52) use an inert mock function (`Invoke-NoticeStandIn`) and temporary directories. They verify PowerShell control-flow, exception handling, and hash verification, but do not execute Inno Setup (`ISCC.exe`), download embedPython, or inspect an installed wheel tree.
- **Finding G1-03 (Legal & Attribution Boundary)**: Upstream license texts preserve verbatim truth: ANTLR 4.9.3 (2,699 bytes, SHA-256 `b1b379fc...`) retains its JavaScript MIT section; proxy-tools 0.1.0 (1,436 bytes, SHA-256 `a428fb8a...`) preserves its `<COPYRIGHT HOLDER>` placeholder, trailing syntax, and BSD source vs MIT metadata discrepancy. These document component provenance without constituting formal legal clearance.

### Group 2: Generated Drain and Cancellation
- **Finding G2-01 (Tooling Defect / Resolved)**: Preparation command `36af0d` returned exit 1 because PowerShell's `Set-Content` lacks a `-NoClobber` parameter. No admission file was written and no native run began. Repaired in `72420c` using `[System.IO.File]::Open(..., [System.IO.FileMode]::CreateNew)`. Cancel admission used the same repair in `4bd36d`.
- **Finding G2-02 (Documentary Accounting)**: The aggregate byte total in the initial copy plan was corrected in `COPY-BYTES-CORRECTION.md` and `COPY-BYTES-CORRECTION01-ACTUAL.json` without affecting or rerunning native observations.
- **Finding G2-03 (Scope Limitation)**: The child explicitly reports `complete_native_namespace_protection: false`. The payload consists of 328 bytes across ASCII placeholders (including 60-byte ASCII `model.bin`). These observations prove handle adoption, IPC protocol sequencing, and process isolation, but do not qualify real Whisper neural network weights, audio decoding, VAD, or durable quarantine recovery after unexpected crashes.

### Group 3: Actual Adapter Connection on Windows
- **Finding G3-01 (Architecture Boundary)**: In [`proposal/generated_adapter_flow.py`](file:///C:/Users/hello/AppData/Local/AgentControlRoom/worktrees/uoink-library/e30846da-321/gemini/docs/library/proof/generated-actual-adapter-2026-09-13/proposal/generated_adapter_flow.py#L141-L173), adapter execution relies on `generated_authority_seams` to supply a temporary `GeneratedLifecyclePort`, mock `_release`, and proxy resolver while `REAL_APPROVAL` is absent. Production service globals remain `None` outside the context.
- **Finding G3-02 (Scope Limitation)**: The child explicitly reports `complete_native_namespace_protection: false`; `large-v3-turbo` is an unweighted policy label. The single native drain observation (`fc23ea`, exit 0, 0.9092s) does not exercise weight loading, audio decoding, VAD, native startup failure, or crash recovery.

---

## Pauses and Integration Status

